# Stingcaster Mage has haste but not flash (it is not Snapcaster Mage): with Bot2's Lightning Bolt on the stack, Bot1's next
# priority does not offer it (CR 307.1, 307.5 / creature spells are cast at sorcery speed), though it is cast in Bot1's own
# main phase on turn 3 (the control). Its trigger is "target instant or sorcery card in your graveyard" (CR 115.1): Bot1's
# graveyard holds only Ornithopter (a creature card) and Bot2's graveyard holds the Bolt, so there is no legal target, the
# trigger is removed from the stack without asking anything (CR 603.3d), and the Bolt in the other graveyard gains nothing.

